+# speed2_scenes.txt - S3-15: what a scene change costs. The island hub, its menu and the screens one press away
+# (citizens, news, family, options), there and back. Each window is one change: the PS1 reads the code of
+# the new scene's overlay group in ONE frame (the worst frame of the window, and the "ovl:" lines of its tty log),
+# the GBA has no overlays. Pairs: the cursor rests on the entry for 40 frames before A (the PS1 reads the group
+# ahead meanwhile, ovl_prefetch) and the same without a rest (a shortcut key); the way back (B). A Hellvile Park
+# Classic island (life_speed.txt's keys). Window rules: speed2_fair.txt.
+wait 40
+expect-log doomo: init
+sync on 61
+seed 1
+scene NEW_ISLAND
+wait 10
+press A
+wait 20
+press A
+wait 2
+press A
+wait 10
+expect-scene ISLAND
+wait 60
+
+# ---- menu: Citizens (the cursor rests), and the way back ----
+press START
+wait 40
+fps start
+press A
+wait 45
+expect-scene ROSTER
+fps scenes: island menu -> citizens (cursor rested)
+shot sc_roster
+fps start
+press B
+wait 45
+expect-scene ISLAND
+fps scenes: citizens -> island (B)
+shot sc_island_back
+press B
+wait 20
+
+# ---- the same without a rest: L opens the news at once ----
+wait 20
+fps start
+press L
+wait 45
+expect-scene NEWS
+fps scenes: island -> news (L, no rest)
+shot sc_news
+fps start
+press B
+wait 45
+expect-scene ISLAND
+fps scenes: news -> island (B)
+
+# ---- menu: Family (five rows down), rest, A ----
+press START
+wait 10
+press DOWN
+press DOWN
+press DOWN
+press DOWN
+press DOWN
+wait 40
+fps start
+press A
+wait 45
+expect-scene FAMILY
+fps scenes: island menu -> family (cursor rested)
+shot sc_family
+fps start
+press B
+wait 45
+expect-scene ISLAND
+fps scenes: family -> island (B)
+press B
+wait 20
+
+# ---- menu: Options (four rows down), rest, A ----
+press START
+wait 10
+press DOWN
+press DOWN
+press DOWN
+press DOWN
+wait 40
+fps start
+press A
+wait 45
+expect-scene OPTIONS
+fps scenes: island menu -> options (cursor rested)
+shot sc_options
+fps start
+press B
+wait 45
+expect-scene ISLAND
+fps scenes: options -> island (B)
+press B
+wait 20
